{
  "id": "def-sfb-finite-upper-star-monoidal",
  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "Strong monoidal structure on $g^*$",
  "statement": "Let $\\mathcal A$ and $g$ be as in [lem-sfb-finite-upper-star-unit]. The *monoidal\nstructure* on $g^*$ is the oplax monoidal structure mate, under $g^*\\dashv g_*$\n([def-sfb-finite-upper-lower-star-adjunction]), of the lax structure of\n[def-sfb-finite-lower-star-lax-monoidal]. Its structure maps are invertible by\n[lem-sfb-finite-upper-star-unit] and [lem-sfb-finite-upper-star-tensor], so $g^*$ is a\nstrong monoidal functor.",
